course: dictionary
lesson: 4043
title: Gemini: the twins in the sky
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Gemini is a name, so it starts with a capital letter. It is a proper noun, the name of one special thing. The word comes from Latin and means «twins».
explain: «Taurus has the V-shaped Hyades and the Pleiades, and Gemini has the twin stars Castor and Pollux, both high on winter evenings in the north.» The sentence puts Gemini next to Taurus and talks about stars, so Gemini is a group of stars in the night sky, not a person.
explain: Gemini can also mean a star sign. People born roughly late May to late June are called Geminis. Star signs come from astrology, a belief, and scientists say they do not predict personality or the future.
fact: Gemini is a constellation, a group of stars that makes a pattern in the night sky.
fact: Its bright stars include Castor and Pollux, named after twin brothers in Greek myths.
fact: Gemini is also one of the twelve star signs, for people born roughly late May to late June.
fact: Project Gemini was a NASA space programme in the 1960s that flew two astronauts at a time, before the Apollo Moon landings.
fact: Scientists say star signs do not predict personality or the future.
exercise: In «Gemini has the twin stars Castor and Pollux», what is Gemini? | *A group of stars in the night sky | A kind of cloud | A famous footballer | A type of cat
exercise: Why does Gemini start with a capital G? | Because it is a very important word | *Because it is the name of one particular thing | Because it is a verb | Because it is at the start of every sentence
exercise: The word gemini comes from Latin. What does it mean? | Space | Winter | Stars | *Twins
test: Which twin stars are in the constellation Gemini? | Hyades and Pleiades | Apollo and Gemini | Sirius and Vega | *Castor and Pollux
test: What was Project Gemini? | A Greek myth about twins | A group of stars in Taurus | A school for young astronauts | *A NASA space programme in the 1960s that flew two astronauts at a time
exam: Which statement about the star sign Gemini is true? | *Scientists say star signs do not predict personality or the future | Star signs show exactly when a person will be famous | Gemini is a planet that people are born on | Scientists say star signs predict your personality
